# PulseAlpha does not require environment variables while it uses simulated data.
#
# When you add a production data provider, keep the real values in a SERVER-SIDE
# environment only. Do not expose provider keys in browser JavaScript, HTML,
# client-side build variables, screenshots, or committed .env files.
#
# MARKET_DATA_PROVIDER=
# MARKET_DATA_API_KEY=
# MARKET_DATA_BASE_URL=
